# Bot2 takes Bot1's Fblthp with Old Man of the Sea. It controls the trigger and draws exactly its last two cards. Bot1's
# Platinum Angel prevents Bot2 from winning, and Fblthp reaches its owner's library while the game remains in progress
# (CR 104.2b, 701.24c); no failed draw occurs, so Bot2 does not lose to a state-based action.

